      },
      "lineNbr": 88,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000039
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-05-01T17:50:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Frankly, I don\u0027t think this is a good idea to require the user to specify the serial number of the Cr50, this script should be able to figure out the case when a single SuzyQ is connected, and should give SuzyQ priority over servod, we want to be able to test bare CCD without servo/servod involved, this is where our problems are.",
      "parentUuid": "107b9b0d_2416cfc9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 70,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 88,
        "endChar": 2
      },
